<title>USA: TransTechnology buys 100,000 of its shares.</title>
<headline>TransTechnology buys 100,000 of its shares.</headline>
<dateline>LIBERTY CORNER, N.J. 1996-09-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>TransTechnology Corp said Friday it had purchased 100,000 shares of its common stock from a private estate at $16.25 per share.</p>
<p>The company said another 308,875 shares were purchased from the same estate at the same price by several institutional investors.</p>
<p>TransTechnology said funds for its transaction were provided by its existing line of credit. The company said it now owns 277,500 shares, or slightly more than five percent of its stock.</p>
